%
% AC-3 (deterministic): an over-determined antecedent {primary, backup} for the
% functional slot route(traffic, ·). The base world's gmeow:overrides edge
% primary >- backup makes the maximum unique -> primary wins -> exactly one world.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/worlds-c/revision/').
:- counterfactual(ex:cf, ex:base).
:- assume(ex:route(ex:traffic, ex:primary)).
:- assume(ex:route(ex:traffic, ex:backup)).
?- ex:route(ex:traffic, Z).
